          "content": {
            "id": "2e742703-b925-394c-baef-79512b3d2955",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Cybersecurity: The innovation and worries around agentic AI",
            "description": "<p>AI is being deployed on both fronts of the cyber battlefield \u2014 from the cybersecurity firms offering protection to consumers and from hackers.</p>\n<p>TECHnalysis Research, LLC President Bob O'Donnell sits down with Yahoo Finance markets and data editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> on Market Catalysts to outline the innovation and worries tied to the deployment of agentic AI, especially when it is used in cybersecurity capacities.</p>\n<p>Watch Yahoo Finance's interview with CrowdStrike (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWD\">CRWD</a>) president <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/ai-era-cybersecurity-dangerous-crowdstrike-220838093.html\">Michael Sentonas</a> on how the cybersecurity industry is using AI to combat hacks. Also read up on how North Korean hackers were responsible for <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/north-korea-just-had-its-biggest-year-ever-stealing-cryptocurrency-130002485.html\">over $2 billion in crypto losses</a> in 2025.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
