        {
          "id": "8b5202c9-0c42-3dbf-b1e0-292f18d7ce1b",
          "content": {
            "id": "8b5202c9-0c42-3dbf-b1e0-292f18d7ce1b",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Cyber scams on the rise: How to avoid getting phished by hackers",
            "description": "<p>Americans lost $12.5 billion in scams in 2025, according to a report from the US Federal Trade Commission (FTC), a whopping 25% increase from last year.</p>\n<p>Push Security CTO Mark Orlando discusses how to spot cyber scams and phishing messages, going into detail on a recent scandal where hackers used malicious Calendly links to trick people and gain their login info.</p>\n<p>Catch Mark Orlando explain <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/phishing-scams-becoming-prevalent-linkedin-150028882.html\">where new online scams are becoming most prevalent </a>\u2014 such as on networking sites like LinkedIn.</p>\n<p>Watch Yahoo Finance's interview with CrowdStrike (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWD\">CRWD</a>) president <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/ai-era-cybersecurity-dangerous-crowdstrike-220838093.html\">Michael Sentonas</a> on how the cybersecurity industry is using AI to combat hacks. Also read up on how North Korean hackers were responsible for <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/north-korea-just-had-its-biggest-year-ever-stealing-cryptocurrency-130002485.html\">over $2 billion in crypto losses</a> in 2025.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
